      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After some helpful hints from @{5f2e0a4e8464150716ffd322|full_name}, I intensively tested with different settings today. With this settings, jump and turn feels mostly the same like prior input 2.0. But difficult to say, if every controller reacts exactly the same. \n\nRotate: Deadzone 25%, Overlap 5%\n\nJump: Deadzone 50%, Overlap 5%",
