  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Before Input 2.0, jump and turn was a clearly separated action on the Vive wands. When I turn now (specially to left), I accidentally jump in many cases. I tried to change the dead zone and zone mix settings in the Steam bindings. It helped a little, but it's not possible to re-create the old \"rock solid\" behaviour.",
